# Build context is the repo root (see apps/api/Dockerfile).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/logs
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git
docs
# The web app is not part of the API image; only its package.json is needed
# so npm ci can validate the workspace lockfile.
apps/web/*
!apps/web/package.json
